TI  - medAL-suite: A software solution for creating and deploying complex clinical decision support algorithms.
AU  - Cobuccio, Ludovico Gennaro
AU  - Faivre, Vincent
AU  - Tan, Rainer
AU  - Vonlanthen, Alan
AU  - Beynon, Fenella
