TI  - Pregnant women's experiences with an integrated diagnostic and decision support device for antenatal care in Ghana.
AU  - Abejirinde, Ibukun-Oluwa Omolade
AU  - Douwes, Renate
AU  - Bardají, Azucena
AU  - Abugnaba-Abanga, Rudolf
AU  - Zweekhorst, Marjolein
