TI  - Impact of digital clinical decision support on quality of care and antibiotic stewardship for children under five in South-Central Somalia.
AU  - Hürlimann, Eveline
AU  - Landi, Marco
AU  - Miikkulainen, Alli
AU  - Renner, Camille
AU  - Musard, Capucine
AU  - Mohamed, Hassan Hussein
AU  - Ali, Hassan Abdullahi
