TI  - Assessing adoption of human and AI-enabled diabetic retinopathy screening in primary healthcare settings: findings from a pragmatic trial.
AU  - Chauhan, Anshul
AU  - Vale, Luke
AU  - Kankaria, Ankita
AU  - Gupta, Vishali
AU  - Kaur, Gagandeep
AU  - N, Neha
